cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use blender-mcp-rs in your research or tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "blender-mcp-rs: High-Performance Reflective Rust MCP Server for Blender"
abstract: >-
  A native Rust Model Context Protocol (MCP) server and spatial agent runtime
  for Blender. Features sub-millisecond reflective tool dispatch, zero-copy shared
  memory viewport streaming, Rapier3D convex collision hull generation, and automated
  multi-agent configuration for autonomous engineering workflows.
type: software
authors:
